I am looking at lentils.
Then I see Prakash.
Prakash is my colleague.
I call Prakash happily.
"Namaskaram Prakash!" I say.
Prakash sees me.
"Hello Maya!"
"What do you want?" Prakash asks.
"I want lentils," I say.
I take the lentils.
Prakash takes a yellow packet.
It is banana chips.
"I like banana chips very much!" I say.
"I also like this," Prakash says.
Prakash smiles.
"Do you want one packet, Maya?" Prakash asks.
"Yes, I want one packet," I say.
I put that packet in my basket.
We talk for a little while.
